### **The queen discipline of winter**

Very popular with members who love silence, the sound of skis gliding over snow, the icy breath. Climbing through woods and snowy slopes to glide lightly back down to the valley. The greatest expression of freedom in the mountains.

Over the years we have visited most of the Alpine arc, from the Aosta Valley to the Val Pusteria, and gone as far as the heart of the Mediterranean, on Etna.

##### **Activities:**

We organise trips for beginners who want to approach this wonderful world, ski touring gatherings and, for the most demanding and best trained, multi-day outings in every corner of the Alps.
